        IF `the application is made to a single Judge sitting in the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal and is filed and served on all parties who have an interest in the appeal` AND (`the date the application was filed and served` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act`) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within 14 days after the date on which that direction or order is made" (a period the text fixes in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))
