§§ `Rule 41 -- transfer of appeal from Court of Appeal to Appellate Division`

DECLARE `o 18 r 41(1) matter the Court of Appeal is to have regard to` IS ONE OF
    `o 18 r 41(1)(a) the appeal was not made to the Court of Appeal in accordance with section 29C of that Act`
    `o 18 r 41(1)(b) none of the legal issues raised on appeal engage any of the matters set out in the Sixth Schedule to that Act`
    `o 18 r 41(1)(c) all of the legal issues raised on appeal in relation to the matters set out in the Sixth Schedule to that Act relate to issues of settled law`

